<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτομ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, pecul. fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότομος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abrupt, sheer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.78
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
				Subst., <i>split</i> or <i>hewn piece of wood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.1.2
			</span></i>; <i>javelin used in athletic games,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> fiery <i>dart,</i> prob.
			l. in <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				28
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
